title: "When does intra-urban temperature information change heat-adaptation priorities? Analysis code and derived-data companion"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived-data companion for heat-adaptation priorities in Valencia
  and Madrid, including independent-site spatial checks and climate-shelter
  opening-hour resource analysis. Raw restricted sensor records are excluded.
